LRC n=14 permutohedron audit -- codex-2026-06-01 S526

GEOMETRIC MODEL
========================================================================
The circular order of {0, v_i t} is a chamber of the affine braid fan.
Collision times are adjacent-swap facets of the permutohedron.
THM-384 makes the LRC target the long-long pair of gaps adjacent to
the observer.  A counterexample would be a closed one-parameter sweep
through these chambers avoiding every long-long source facet.

